Package: ppd-arm-sync
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GhfunNiHe <bbcctv520@petalmail.com>
Depends: power-profiles-daemon, dbus, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Sync CPU governor when power-profiles-daemon profile changes
 Maps power-profiles-daemon profiles to actual CPU frequency governors
 on ARM devices that lack ACPI platform_profile support.
 .
 power-saver  → powersave governor
 balanced     → schedutil governor
 performance  → performance governor
 .
 Also enables the fake driver for power-profiles-daemon so KDE Plasma
 recognizes power profiles correctly.
